  <p id="c-songshu-042-wanghong:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-042-wanghong:p001:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAA">王弘</persName>字<persName id="c-songshu-042-wanghong:p001:m0003" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAA">休元</persName>，琅邪臨沂人也。曾祖<persName id="c-songshu-042-wanghong:p001:m0015" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAA">導</persName>，晉丞相。祖<persName id="c-songshu-042-wanghong:p001:m0022" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAA">洽</persName>，中領軍。父<persName id="c-songshu-042-wanghong:p001:m0029" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAA">珣</persName>，司徒。</p>
</text>
